#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:71
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here you can set how the particles are distributed in the spray area. The "
"particles are distributed using `polar coordinates <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Polar_coordinate_system>`_, so you can set different distributions for "
"the angle and the distance of the particles relative to the center of the "
"spray area."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj lahko nastavite, kako so delci porazdeljeni v območju razpršila. Delci "
"so porazdeljeni s pomočjo \"polarnih koordinat <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Polar_coordinate_system>\"_, tako da lahko nastavite različne "
"porazdelitve za kot in razdaljo delcev glede na središče območja razpršila."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:74
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can specify how the particles are distributed around the center using "
"one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"Določite lahko, kako so delci razporejeni po središču z eno od naslednjih "
"možnosti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Uniform`: Distributes the particles uniformly. Each angle is "
"equally likely to receive a particle."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Uniform': Delce porazdeli enakomerno. Vsak kot je enako možnosti, "
"da prejme delca."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:77
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Curve`: You can set a custom curve that models how the particles "
"should be distributed. The left side of the curve represents an angle of 0 "
"degrees and the right side an angle of 360 degrees. Higher values in the "
"vertical direction mean that there is a higher probability that a particle "
"ends up at that particular angle. In the spray area the angle increases "
"clockwise."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Krivulje': Nastavite lahko krivulje po meri, ki modelira, kako je "
"treba delce porazdeliti. Leva stran krivule predstavlja kot 0 stopinj in "
"desno stran kot 360 stopinj. Višje vrednosti v navpični smeri pomenijo, da "
"obstaja višja verjetnost, da delec konča pod tem določenim kotom. V pršilnem "
"območju se kot poveča v smeri urinega kazalca."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:79
msgid "Angular"
msgstr "Kot"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Repeat`: Have the curve repeat itself multiple times from 0 to "
"360 degrees. Without this, you would need to build a very complex curve with "
"too many control points to achieve the same result."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Ponovi': Naj se krivunja večkrat ponovi od 0 do 360 stopinj. Brez "
"tega bi morali zgraditi zelo zapleteno krivuljo s preveč kontrolnimi "
"točkami, da bi dosegli enak rezultat."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can specify how the particles are distributed from the center to the "
"edge of the spray area using one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"Določite lahko, kako so delci razporejeni od središča do roba področja "
"razpršila z eno od naslednjih možnosti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:84
#, fuzzy
msgid ":guilabel:`Uniform`: Distributes the particles uniformly."
msgstr ":guilabel:'Uniform': Delce porazdeli enakomerno."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:86
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Center-biased spread (legacy)`: This option ensures compatibility "
"with the brushes made prior to version 5.1. Before, the particles were "
"distributed uniformly in terms of distance from the center, but that ended "
"up concentrating more particles in the center of the spray area from a 2d "
"space perspective. For example, a circumference at a distance of 10 pixels "
"from the center ended having roughly the same number of particles as a "
"circumference at a distance of 100 pixels, while being 10 times smaller in "
"length."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Center-prislonjena širitev (zapuščina)\": Ta možnost zagotavlja "
"združljivost s čopiči, narejenimi pred različico 5.1. Prej so bili delci "
"enakomerno porazdeljeni glede na oddaljenost od središča, vendar se je na "
"koncu z vidika 2d prostora v središču območja razpršila več delcev. Na "
"primer, obsežnost na razdalji 10 pik od središča se je končala s približno "
"enakim številom delcev kot obsežnost na razdalji 100 pik, medtem ko je 10-"
"krat manjša v dolžino."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:88
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gaussian`: distributes the particles using a gaussian or `normal "
"distribution <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution>`_."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Gaussian': delce porazdeli z gavsovsko ali \"normalno "
"porazdelitvijo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Normal_distribution>\"_."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:90
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Standard deviation`: Sets the standard deviation of the "
"distribution. Higher values will make the particles more spread."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:\"Standardni odklon\": Določa standardni odklon porazdelitve. "
"Zaradi višjih vrednosti se bodo delci bolj razširili."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:91
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Center-biased spread (legacy)`: This option ensures compatibility "
"with the brushes made prior to version 5.1. See the previous point for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Center-prislonjena širitev (zapuščina)\": Ta možnost zagotavlja "
"združljivost s čopiči, narejenimi pred različico 5.1. Če želite več "
"informacij, si oglejte prejšnjo točko."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cluster`: This will allow you to quickly concentrate the "
"particles towards the center or the edge of the spray area."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Cluster': To vam bo omogočilo hitro koncentracijo delcev proti "
"središču ali robu pršilnega območja."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Clustering amount`: Positive values will make the particles "
"concentrate towards the center of the spray area. Negative values will make "
"the particles concentrate towards the border of the spray area. Values near "
"0 will make the particles spread more uniformly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Količina gruče': Zaradi pozitivnih vrednosti se bodo delci "
"koncentrirani proti središču pršilnega območja. Zaradi negativnih vrednosti "
"se bodo delci koncentrirani proti meji pršilnega območja. Vrednosti blizu 0 "
"bodo delce bolj enakomerno razširile."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:97
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Curve`: You can set a custom curve that models how the particles "
"should be distributed. The left side of the curve represents the center of "
"the spray area and the right side represents its border. Higher values in "
"the vertical direction mean that there is a higher probability that a "
"particle ends up at that particular distance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:'Krivulje': Nastavite lahko krivulje po meri, ki modelira, kako je "
"treba delce porazdeliti. Leva stran krivule predstavlja središče območja "
"razpršila, na desni strani pa njeno obrobo. Višje vrednosti v navpični smeri "
"pomenijo, da obstaja višja verjetnost, da delec konča na tej določeni "
"razdalji."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:99
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "Porazdelitev"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:99
msgid "Radial"
msgstr "Radialno"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/spray_brush_engine.rst:99
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Repeat`: Have the curve repeat itself multiple times from the "
